     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.1999998092651px;line-height:20px\"></span><div style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);border:none;line-height:1.2;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Hi all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">This week at D-RUG we’ll have a joint talk by <a href=\"http://ucdavis.academia.edu/RyanPeek\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ucdavis.academia.edu/RyanPeek&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468406885000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3c7qugxvMdz5j-DsOM3_di\">Ryan Peek</a> and <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/mtobiasresearch/\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sites.google.com/site/mtobiasresearch/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468406885000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3UPpo4MsJvJdH98jHlVUAj\">Michele Tobias</a> about different approaches to producing maps in R, including <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggmap/index.html\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggmap/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468406885000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1UegeH8i_xNM4a-W_xeCaQ\">ggmap</a>, <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/googleVis/index.html\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/googleVis/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468406885000&amp;usg=AOvVaw29YTONlBfqqiPDbtNESTcB\">googlevis</a>, and <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/leafletR/index.html\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/leafletR/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468406885000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0reFG2ipeTajZbaVjy8JvT\">leafletR</a>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">For a preview of the kinds of maps you can create with these tools, see <a href=\"http://micheletobias.github.io/maps/DistributionsMap.html\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://micheletobias.github.io/maps/DistributionsMap.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468406885000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cHVUcBBw9luRUE4Js5B2_\">Michele’s maps of California Beach Plant Species Distributions</a>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">We’ll webcast the talk at this link: <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/events/csq6las4056etldd0t8isauebho\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://plus.google.com/events/csq6las4056etldd0t8isauebho&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468406885000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1txsHTmbNvLv3_6cj4rBR0\">https://plus.google.com/events/csq6las4056etldd0t8isauebho</a>.  Video and code will be available afterwards.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Best, </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Noam</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PHNwYW4gc3R5bGU9ImNvbG9yOiByZ2IoMzMsIDMzLCAzMyk7IGZvbnQtZmFtaWx5OiAnSGVsdmV0\r\naWNhIE5ldWUnLCBIZWx2ZXRpY2EsIEFyaWFsLCBzYW5zLXNlcmlmOyBmb250LXNpemU6IDEzLjE5\r\nOTk5OTgwOTI2NTFweDsgbGluZS1oZWlnaHQ6IDIwcHg7Ij5IaSBhbGwsPC9zcGFuPjxkaXYgc3R5\r\nbGU9ImNvbG9yOiByZ2IoMzMsIDMzLCAzMyk7IGZvbnQtZmFtaWx5OiAnSGVsdmV0aWNhIE5ldWUn\r\nLCBIZWx2ZXRpY2EsIEFyaWFsLCBzYW5zLXNlcmlmOyBmb250LXNpemU6IDEzLjE5OTk5OTgwOTI2\r\nNTFweDsgbGluZS1oZWlnaHQ6IDIwcHg7Ij48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdiBzdHlsZT0iY29sb3